      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unverify on account A, verify on account B.\n\nSome users don't care about unverifying another account, since a lot of these trolls who will ban evade from groups don't have one dedicated/main account they do most things on.\n\nAnonymity can be a pain in the butt when people want to use it for malicious purposes, but that's just how it goes sometimes, I'm afraid.\n\nAnd before you say to make it harder to unverify and reverify your age, well, that would just be punishing everyone for the actions of a few select bad actors. That's an action that is inadvisable almost everywhere, and for good reason. A lot of games which do this when their player base is smaller end up dying out entirely, and even very large games will lose a big chunk of their player base once an update that does this gets pushed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
