      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6714bbda2b3f1f266e0a7a0f|full_name} You’re right that age verification systems have challenges.\n\nBut new users who get crashed or harassed repeatedly often quit VRChat and never come back. Adding an option for age-verified instances could help create safer spaces to keep new players engaged.\n\nMaybe a cooldown or some extra steps when switching verified accounts could also be a solution.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
