  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-12-17T18:49:50.608Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allowing groups to create instances restricted to players who have completed age verification, regardless of their verified age, is an effective way to ensure a safe and secure space.\n\nCurrently, a player can verify his age with only one VRChat account. This feature would prevent malicious users who have been banned from joining group instances by creating new accounts.",
